Suppose tumhe kisi server ke baare mein investigate karna hai.

Tumhare paas ho sakta hai:

IP address
Domain
Hostname
Software name
Software version
File hash
CVE number
Suspicious file
Username
Threat actor

Ab question hai:

“Is information ko search kahan karun?”

