🐧 12. Linux MAN Pages

Ab ye tumhare Linux learning ke liye super important hai.

Terminal mein:

man <command>

Example:

man nc

nc = netcat.

Tumhe command ka manual mil jayega.

🧠 MAN page ko kaise read karna hai?

Example:

NC

Ye command ka naam.

Then:

NAME

Yahan short description.

Example:

nc — arbitrary TCP and UDP connections and listens

Meaning:

nc TCP/UDP connections establish/listen karne ke kaam aa sakta hai.

Phir:

SYNOPSIS

Ye command ka syntax/template hota hai.

Example:

nc [options] [destination] [port]

Isko beginner style mein:

nc
│
├── options
├── destination
└── port

Samjho.

🔥 13. MAN pages tumhare liye kyun important hain?

Tum Kali/Linux aur cybersecurity seekh rahe ho, toh ye habit bana lo:

Agar command nahi pata:

❌ Random Google command copy-paste mat karo.

Pehle:

man nmap

ya:

man nc

ya:

man ssh

ya:

man grep

Aur quick help ke liye kai commands:

command --help

support karti hain.

