⚠️ 15. GitHub ka sabse important warning

Ye line bahut seriously yaad rakhna:

GitHub par code available hai iska matlab safe nahi hai.

Koi repository ka naam:

CVE-XXXX-XXXXX-PoC

rakh dene se wo automatically legitimate nahi ban jaati.

Malicious repository bhi ho sakti hai.

Isliye:

Repository
    ↓
Read README
    ↓
Check author
    ↓
Check repository history
    ↓
Read source code
    ↓
Understand dependencies
    ↓
Use isolated lab

Blindly:

./exploit

mat chala dena. 😄

